#. module: account_peppol
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_peppol/exceptions.py:0
msgid ""
"Although the message document is well formed and schema valid, some element/"
"attribute contains a value that could not be recognized and therefore could "
"not be used by the MSH."
msgstr ""
"ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າເອກະສານຂໍ້ຄວາມຈະມີໂຄງສ້າງທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ ແລະ ສອດຄ່ອງກັບ schema, ແຕ່ບາງອົງປະກອບ/"
"ຄຸນລັກສະນະມີຄ່າທີ່ບໍ່ສາມາດຮັບຮູ້ໄດ້ ແລະ ດັ່ງນັ້ນ MSH ຈຶ່ງບໍ່ສາມາດນຳໃຊ້ໄດ້."

#. module: account_peppol
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_peppol/exceptions.py:0
msgid ""
"Although the message document is well formed and schema valid, some element/"
"attribute value cannot be processed as expected because the related feature "
"is not supported by the MSH."
msgstr ""
"ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າເອກະສານຂໍ້ຄວາມຈະມີໂຄງສ້າງທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ ແລະ ສອດຄ່ອງກັບ schema, ແຕ່ຄ່າຂອງບາງອົງປະກອບ/"
"ຄຸນລັກສະນະບໍ່ສາມາດປະມວນຜົນຕາມທີ່ຄາດຫວັງໄດ້ ເນື່ອງຈາກ MSH ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບຄຸນສົມບັດທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ."

#. module: account_peppol
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_peppol/exceptions.py:0
msgid ""
"Although the message document is well formed and schema valid, some element/"
"attribute value is inconsistent either with the content of other element/"
"attribute, or with the processing mode of the MSH, or with the normative "
"requirements of the ebMS specification."
msgstr ""
"ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າເອກະສານຂໍ້ຄວາມຈະມີໂຄງສ້າງທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ ແລະ ສອດຄ່ອງກັບ schema, ແຕ່ຄ່າຂອງບາງອົງປະກອບ/"
"ຄຸນລັກສະນະບໍ່ສອດຄ່ອງກັບເນື້ອໃນຂອງອົງປະກອບ/ຄຸນລັກສະນະອື່ນ, ຫຼື ບໍ່ສອດຄ່ອງກັບຮູບແບບການປະມວນຜົນຂອງ "
"MSH, ຫຼື ກັບຂໍ້ກຳນົດມາດຕະຖານຂອງ ebMS."

#. module: account_peppol
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_peppol/exceptions.py:0
msgid ""
"Although the message document is well formed and schema valid, the presence "
"or absence of some element/ attribute is not consistent with the capability "
"of the MSH, with respect to supported features."
msgstr ""
"ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າເອກະສານຂໍ້ຄວາມຈະມີໂຄງສ້າງທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ ແລະ ສອດຄ່ອງກັບ schema, ແຕ່ການມີຢູ່ ຫຼື "
"ບໍ່ມີຂອງບາງອົງປະກອບ/ຄຸນລັກສະນະ ບໍ່ສອດຄ່ອງກັບຄວາມສາມາດຂອງ MSH ໃນສ່ວນທີ່ກ່ຽວກັບຄຸນສົມບັດທີ່ຮອງຮັບ."

#. module: account_peppol
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_peppol/exceptions.py:0
msgid ""
"Although the message was sent under Guaranteed delivery requirement, the "
"Reliability module could not get assurance that the message was properly "
"delivered, in spite of resending efforts."
msgstr ""
"ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າຂໍ້ຄວາມຈະຖືກສົ່ງພາຍໃຕ້ຂໍ້ກຳນົດການຮັບປະກັນການຈັດສົ່ງ, "
"ແຕ່ໂມດູນຄວາມໜ້າເຊື່ອຖືບໍ່ສາມາດໄດ້ຮັບການຢືນຢັນວ່າຂໍ້ຄວາມຖືກຈັດສົ່ງຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ "
"ເຖິງວ່າຈະມີຄວາມພະຍາຍາມສົ່ງຄືນໃໝ່ກໍຕາມ."

#. module: account_peppol
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_peppol/exceptions.py:0
msgid ""
"An Intermediary MSH was unable to route an ebMS message and stopped "
"processing the message."
msgstr "MSH ຄົນກາງບໍ່ສາມາດກຳນົດເສັ້ນທາງຂໍ້ຄວາມ ebMS ໄດ້ ແລະ ໄດ້ຢຸດການປະມວນຜົນຂໍ້ຄວາມດັ່ງກ່າວ."

#. module: account_peppol
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_peppol/exceptions.py:0
msgid ""
"An MSH has determined that the message is expired and will not attempt to "
"forward or deliver it."
msgstr "MSH ໄດ້ກວດພົບວ່າຂໍ້ຄວາມໝົດອາຍຸແລ້ວ ແລະ ຈະບໍ່ພະຍາຍາມສົ່ງຕໍ່ ຫຼື ຈັດສົ່ງຂໍ້ຄວາມນີ້."

#. module: account_peppol
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_peppol/exceptions.py:0
msgid ""
"An entry in the routing function is matched that assigns the message to an "
"MPC for pulling, but the intermediary MSH is unable to store the message "
"with this MPC"
msgstr ""
"ລາຍການໃນຟັງຊັນກຳນົດເສັ້ນທາງກົງກັນທີ່ກຳນົດຂໍ້ຄວາມໄປຍັງ MPC ສຳລັບການດຶງ, ແຕ່ MSH "
"ຄົນກາງບໍ່ສາມາດບັນທຶກຂໍ້ຄວາມກັບ MPC ນີ້ໄດ້"

#. module: account_peppol
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_peppol/exceptions.py:0
msgid "An error occurred during the decompression."
msgstr "ເກີດຂໍ້ຜິດພາດຂຶ້ນໃນລະຫວ່າງການແຕກຟາຍບີບອັດ."

#. module: account_peppol
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_peppol/exceptions.py:0
msgid "An error occurred while decompressing the reassembled message."
msgstr "ເກີດຂໍ້ຜິດພາດຂຶ້ນໃນຂະນະທີ່ແຕກຟາຍບີບອັດຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ປະກອບຄືນໃໝ່."

#. module: account_peppol
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_peppol/models/account_edi_proxy_user.py:0
msgid ""
"An error occurred while responding to this invoice's expeditor.%(br)sStatus: "
"%(status)s - %(error)s"
msgstr ""
"ເກີດຂໍ້ຜິດພາດຂຶ້ນໃນຂະນະທີ່ກຳລັງຕອບກັບຜູ້ສົ່ງໃບເກັບເງິນນີ້.%(br)sສະຖານະ: %(status)s - %(error)s"

#. module: account_peppol
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_peppol/exceptions.py:0
msgid ""
"An incoming message fragment has a a value greater than the known "
"FragmentCount."
msgstr "ສ່ວນຍ່ອຍຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມຂາເຂົ້າ ມີຄ່າໃຫຍ່ກວ່າ FragmentCount ທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້."

#. module: account_peppol
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_peppol/exceptions.py:0
msgid ""
"An intermediary MSH has assigned the message to an MPC for pulling and has "
"successfully stored it. However the intermediary set a limit on the time it "
"was prepared to wait for the message to be pulled, and that limit has been "
"reached."
msgstr ""
"MSH ຄົນກາງໄດ້ກຳນົດຂໍ້ຄວາມໄປຍັງ MPC ສຳລັບການດຶງ ແລະ ໄດ້ບັນທຶກໄວ້ສຳເລັດແລ້ວ. ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ "
"ຄົນກາງໄດ້ກຳນົດເວລາຈຳກັດໃນການລໍຖ້າໃຫ້ຂໍ້ຄວາມຖືກດຶງ, ແລະ ຮອດກຳນົດເວລາດັ່ງກ່າວແລ້ວ."

#. module: account_peppol
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_peppol/exceptions.py:0
msgid "An internal error occurred"
msgstr "ເກີດຂໍ້ຜິດພາດພາຍໃນລະບົບ"

#. module: account_peppol
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:account_peppol.selection__account_peppol_response__response_code__ap
msgid "Approval"
msgstr "ການອະນຸມັດ"

#. module: account_peppol
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:account_peppol.selection__account_move__peppol_move_state__ap
msgid "Approved"
msgstr "ອະນຸມັດແລ້ວ"

#. module: account_peppol
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_peppol/models/account_edi_proxy_user.py:0
#: code:addons/account_peppol/wizard/peppol_rejection_wizard.py:0
msgid "At least one reason must be given when rejecting a Peppol invoice."
msgstr "ຕ້ອງລະບຸເຫດຜົນຢ່າງໜ້ອຍໜຶ່ງຂໍ້ ເມື່ອປະຕິເສດໃບເກັບເງິນ Peppol."

#. module: account_peppol
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/account_peppol/static/src/components/peppol_auth/peppol_auth_service.js:0
msgid "Authentication canceled"
msgstr "ການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນຖືກຍົກເລີກ"

#. module: account_peppol
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/account_peppol/static/src/components/peppol_auth/peppol_auth_service.js:0
msgid "Authentication failed"
msgstr "ການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນບໍ່ສຳເລັດ"

