"You cannot reset to draft invoices that were sent via Peppol / PDP. If you "
"need to modify them, you must issue a credit or debit note."
msgstr ""

#. module: account_peppol
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_peppol/exceptions.py:0
msgid "You don't have enough credit"
msgstr "ຍອດເງິນຂອງທ່ານບໍ່ພຽງພໍ"

#. module: account_peppol
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_peppol/exceptions.py:0
msgid ""
"You have reached the limit of documents you can send today. Retry later. "
"Please contact the support if you think you need to increase that limit."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານໄດ້ສົ່ງເອກະສານຮອດຂີດຈຳກັດຂອງມື້ນີ້ແລ້ວ. ກະລຸນາລອງໃໝ່ພາຍຫຼັງ. ກະລຸນາຕິດຕໍ່ຝ່າຍຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອ "
"ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການເພີ່ມຂີດຈຳກັດດັ່ງກ່າວ."

#. module: account_peppol
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_peppol/wizard/peppol_registration.py:0
msgid "You need to authenticate to continue."
msgstr "ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນເພື່ອດຳເນີນການຕໍ່."

#. module: account_peppol
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:account_peppol.res_config_settings_view_form
msgid ""
"You registration has been rejected, the reason has been sent to you via "
"email.\n"
"                            Please contact our support if you need further "
"assistance."
msgstr ""
"ການລົງທະບຽນຂອງທ່ານຖືກປະຕິເສດ, ເຫດຜົນໄດ້ຖືກສົ່ງໃຫ້ທ່ານຜ່ານທາງອີເມວແລ້ວ.\n"
"                            ກະລຸນາຕິດຕໍ່ຝ່າຍຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອຂອງພວກເຮົາ "
"ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການຄວາມຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

#. module: account_peppol
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:account_peppol.res_config_settings_view_form
msgid "Your Peppol ID"
msgstr "ໄອດີ Peppol ຂອງທ່ານ"

#. module: account_peppol
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:account_peppol.res_config_settings_view_form
msgid "Your Peppol identification is:"
msgstr "ລະຫັດລະບຸຕົວຕົນ Peppol ຂອງທ່ານແມ່ນ:"

#. module: account_peppol
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_peppol/wizard/peppol_registration.py:0
msgid ""
"Your Peppol registration will be activated soon. You can already send "
"invoices."
msgstr "ການລົງທະບຽນ Peppol ຂອງທ່ານຈະຖືກເປີດນຳໃຊ້ໄວໆນີ້. ທ່ານສາມາດເລີ່ມສົ່ງໃບເກັບເງິນໄດ້ແລ້ວ."

#. module: account_peppol
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_peppol/wizard/peppol_registration.py:0
msgid ""
"Your company is already registered on an Access Point (%s) for receiving "
"invoices. We will register you on Odoo as a sender only."
msgstr ""
"ບໍລິສັດຂອງທ່ານໄດ້ລົງທະບຽນເທິງ Access Point (%s) ສຳລັບການຮັບໃບເກັບເງິນໄວ້ແລ້ວ. "
"ພວກເຮົາຈະລົງທະບຽນທ່ານເທິງ Odoo ໃນຖານະຜູ້ສົ່ງເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#. module: account_peppol
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:account_peppol.res_config_settings_view_form
msgid ""
"Your database is not linked to Peppol anymore. This might be due to a "
"database duplication or restoration.\n"
"                                        Make sure to reconnect the correct "
"database."
msgstr ""
"ຖານຂໍ້ມູນຂອງທ່ານບໍ່ໄດ້ເຊື່ອມໂຍງກັບ Peppol ອີກຕໍ່ໄປ. ສິ່ງນີ້ອາດເກີດຈາກການເຮັດສຳເນົາ ຫຼື "
"ການກູ້ຄືນຖານຂໍ້ມູນ.\n"
"                                        ກະລຸນາກວດສອບໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າໄດ້ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຖານຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງຄືນໃໝ່."

#. module: account_peppol
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/account_peppol/static/src/components/peppol_auth/peppol_auth_service.js:0
msgid ""
"Your details are being verified. There is nothing else to do on your end: "
"your Peppol registration will be finalized automatically."
msgstr ""
"ລາຍລະອຽດຂອງທ່ານກຳລັງຢູ່ໃນຂັ້ນຕອນການກວດສອບ. ທ່ານບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງເຮັດຫຍັງເພີ່ມເຕີມ: ການລົງທະບຽນ "
"Peppol ຂອງທ່ານຈະສຳເລັດໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

#. module: account_peppol
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_peppol/exceptions.py:0
msgid "Your identification has not been approved for this action yet"
msgstr "ການລະບຸຕົວຕົນຂອງທ່ານຍັງບໍ່ທັນໄດ້ຮັບການອະນຸມັດສຳລັບການດຳເນີນການນີ້ເທື່ອ"

#. module: account_peppol
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_peppol/wizard/peppol_registration.py:0
msgid "Your identifier does not have a valid format.%s"
msgstr "ລະຫັດລະບຸຂອງທ່ານບໍ່ມີຮູບແບບທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ.%s"

#. module: account_peppol
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_peppol/wizard/peppol_registration.py:0
msgid "Your identifier is invalid."
msgstr "ລະຫັດລະບຸຂອງທ່ານບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ."

#. module: account_peppol
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_peppol/wizard/peppol_registration.py:0
msgid "Your identifier you entered is invalid for Peppol."
msgstr "ລະຫັດລະບຸທີ່ທ່ານປ້ອນເຂົ້າໄປບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງສຳລັບ Peppol."

#. module: account_peppol
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_peppol/wizard/peppol_registration.py:0
msgid ""
"Your registration has been rejected. Please contact the support for further "
"assistance."
msgstr "ການລົງທະບຽນຂອງທ່ານຖືກປະຕິເສດ. ກະລຸນາຕິດຕໍ່ຝ່າຍຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອສຳລັບການຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

#. module: account_peppol
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:account_peppol.res_config_settings_view_form
msgid "Your registration should be activated within a day."
msgstr "ການລົງທະບຽນຂອງທ່ານຄວນຈະຖືກເປີດນຳໃຊ້ພາຍໃນໜຶ່ງວັນ."

#. module: account_peppol
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_peppol/exceptions.py:0
msgid "Your request is still being processed."
msgstr "ຄຳຮ້ອງຂໍຂອງທ່ານຍັງຢູ່ໃນຂັ້ນຕອນການປະມວນຜົນ."

#. module: account_peppol
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_peppol/models/account_edi_proxy_user.py:0
msgid "accepted"
msgstr "ຍອມຮັບແລ້ວ"

#. module: account_peppol
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:account_peppol.peppol_registration_form
msgid "and send invoices via Peppol on their behalf."
msgstr "ແລະ ສົ່ງໃບເກັບເງິນຜ່ານ Peppol ໃນນາມຂອງພວກເຂົາ."

#. module: account_peppol
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:account_peppol.selection__res_partner__invoice_sending_method__peppol
msgid "by Peppol"
msgstr "ໂດຍ Peppol"

#. module: account_peppol
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:account_peppol.mail_notification_layout_with_responsible_signature_and_peppol
msgid "could not be sent via"
msgstr "ບໍ່ສາມາດສົ່ງຜ່ານ"

#. module: account_peppol
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_peppol/models/account_move.py:0
msgid "id"
msgstr "ໄອດີ"

#. module: account_peppol
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_peppol/models/account_edi_proxy_user.py:0
msgid "received"
msgstr "ໄດ້ຮັບແລ້ວ"

#. module: account_peppol
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_peppol/models/account_edi_proxy_user.py:0
msgid "rejected"
msgstr "ປະຕິເສດແລ້ວ"

#. module: account_peppol
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:account_peppol.mail_notification_layout_with_responsible_signature_and_peppol
msgid "sent via"
msgstr "ສົ່ງຜ່ານ"

#. module: account_peppol
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:account_peppol.peppol_registration_form
msgid "support"
msgstr "ຝ່າຍຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອ"

#. module: account_peppol
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:account_peppol.mail_notification_layout_with_responsible_signature_and_peppol
msgid "to send invoices, but this one"
msgstr "ເພື່ອສົ່ງໃບເກັບເງິນ, ແຕ່ລາຍການນີ້"

#. module: account_peppol
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:account_peppol.mail_notification_layout_with_responsible_signature_and_peppol
msgid "uses"
msgstr "ນຳໃຊ້"
